WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.960
Auckland International Airport
welcomes over

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:36.560
350,000 visitors from the USA every year.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:40.360
Many bring dreams of a wonderful holiday,
but this woman

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:44.680
has brought a biosecurity nightmare.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:48.040
I've just seen the most incredible thing,
a cat.

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.400
And the lady says It's a live cat.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.600
That's a first for me.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.480
I've never seen that before.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.600
You can't bring a live
cat into New Zealand.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.520
Not this way.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:59.840
Not through the x-ray.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:03.840
Um, that’s a huge biosecurity risk,

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:06.440
I’m going have to go, I’m
going to talk to her now about it.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.680
The cat and its American owner

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.120
are separated immediately.

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.680
Biosecurity Officer Demi

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:20.120
quickly carries the cat to a secure lab
to prevent the spread

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:24.240
of any infectious diseases,
while officer Phil confronts the owner.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:29.160
I want to talk to you
about the declaration side

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:32.800
of things alright, because live animals
coming into New Zealand

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:37.760
are a big thing for us, diseases
obviously.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.360
Yeah, because it is an offense

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:46.040
to bring, or attempt to bring um, an item
such as a live animal

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:51.800
which is about as big as we get,
into the country without declaring it.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.280
The woman doesn't understand
how serious this is.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:56.480
But Phil does.

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:00.680
There'll be no winners here.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.840
Auckland’s
International Mail Centre processes

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:11.480
an amazing 7,000 parcels and packets
every hour.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.160
Today Customs officer
Alannah is monitoring the mail belt

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:18.400
when she spots an ordinary box
just in from China.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.560
It’s declared as a doll, but out the back,

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.600
Alannah thinks it might be more than that.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.960
So I have this parcel
I found today at the belts, it’s

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:31.160
declared a doll but it definitely
looks like there’s something inside here

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:33.800
so I’m going to open it up
and take a look at it.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:37.960
The declaration matches the contents
but on turning the toy over,

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.000
Alannah notices
tell-tale signs of tampering.

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:45.600
Quite a heavy doll,
um we can clearly see it’s been tampered

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:49.280
with, very poor stitching
which is actually coming undone.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.520
Nobody wants to tear apart
a toy for no good reason.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:56.680
So Alana, X-rays it one more time,
looking at the X-ray image that appears

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.320
to be contained within a sealed bag.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.080
So I'm going to go ahead and
cut it open and examine it.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:04.040
It seems the game is up.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.600
The toy is hiding something
and after some work

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.760
with a knife, Alannah finds a foil bag.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:12.400
The packet concealed within the soft toy,

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.920
It's quite heavy and quite a dense

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.120
crystal-like substance.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:21.800
So, because we can’t test it here
using the first defender, we will take it

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:26.200
over to our secure exhibits room
where we will be able to open it up

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:30.040
and take a sample
and test it in our- a secure

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.480
safe environment.

